    "detailed_description": "&quot;Heartbeat Girlfriend&quot; is the first multi-ending interactive video application of a love-themed VR platform independently developed by Zhongqingbao, holding hands in parallel time and space in a hyper-realistic VR love experience.<br />\r\nThe &quot;Heartbeat Girlfriend&quot; VR love app is set in a college campus, and users enter the application scene with a first-person 360\u00b0 panoramic view, where they meet a girl who is excited and lead users to immerse themselves in the sweet and wonderful moments of real love and dating with a super immersive immersive interactive experience.<br />\r\nProduct highlights<br />\r\n1. Screen<br />\r\nBased on realistic style, ultra-high-definition real shooting of characters and scenes, the picture is more realistic;<br />\r\n\u30fbAdd edge effects to some screens to avoid visual fatigue for players.<br />\r\n2. Narrative<br />\r\nCut in from the first perspective, show the real love scene, and increase the user's sense of participation and immersion;<br />\r\n\u30fbAdd auxiliary NPCs to promote the plot and make the plot fuller.<br />\r\n3. Interaction<br />\r\nLow entry threshold, simple operation, and interactive links can be triggered through specific items or episodes;<br />\r\nTrigger multiple plots according to user selection to stimulate users' desire to explore.<br />\r\n*Interested players can join our QQ exchange group 540344245, and if there are any suggestions, you can exchange feedback inside.",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;Heartbeat Girlfriend&quot; is the first multi-ending interactive video application of a love-themed VR platform independently developed by Zhongqingbao, holding hands in parallel time and space in a hyper-realistic VR love experience.<br />\r\nThe &quot;Heartbeat Girlfriend&quot; VR love app is set in a college campus, and users enter the application scene with a first-person 360\u00b0 panoramic view, where they meet a girl who is excited and lead users to immerse themselves in the sweet and wonderful moments of real love and dating with a super immersive immersive interactive experience.<br />\r\nProduct highlights<br />\r\n1. Screen<br />\r\nBased on realistic style, ultra-high-definition real shooting of characters and scenes, the picture is more realistic;<br />\r\n\u30fbAdd edge effects to some screens to avoid visual fatigue for players.<br />\r\n2. Narrative<br />\r\nCut in from the first perspective, show the real love scene, and increase the user's sense of participation and immersion;<br />\r\n\u30fbAdd auxiliary NPCs to promote the plot and make the plot fuller.<br />\r\n3. Interaction<br />\r\nLow entry threshold, simple operation, and interactive links can be triggered through specific items or episodes;<br />\r\nTrigger multiple plots according to user selection to stimulate users' desire to explore.<br />\r\n*Interested players can join our QQ exchange group 540344245, and if there are any suggestions, you can exchange feedback inside.",
